# Star-join optimization & partition pruning

## Partition pruning — scan only relevant segments

- `WHERE year = 2026` → read 2026's partitions, skip the rest
- Zone maps (§07) skip blocks within → ~1/10th of a 10-year fact

## Star-join optimization — filter fact **by** the dims

- `WHERE product_line = 'Headsets'`:
  1. Scan **small** `DIM_PRODUCT` → matching `product_key`s
  2. Build a **bloom filter**, push down to the fact scan
  3. Read only fact rows whose key is in the set
- Semi-join / bloom pushdown — don't read the whole fact

## Broadcast & co-located joins

- Small dims **broadcast** to every node · shared dist key → **no shuffle** (§05)

## Star beats snowflake **harder** here

- Pruning/pushdown/broadcast love **few, wide, one-hop** dims
